On Sat, Oct 16, 2004 at 02:31:46PM -0700, randall272-fbsd@yahoo.com wrote:
> With 5.1 /stand/sysinstall does not list mlxd0 as device to disklable

Don't use /stand/sysinstall.  It is a wart on our that it even exists in
5.x.  Use /usr/sbin/sysinstall.  Depending on when you first installed
FreeBSD on your AS1000, /stand/sysinstall could be from 4.x and could
give you problems.

-- 
-- David  (obrien@FreeBSD.org)
