PC164LX's firmware isn't big enough to hold both AlphaBIOS and SRM. He'll have
to switch to SRM.

I don't remember the procedure I used to switch mine from AlphaBIOS to SRM; I
just know it took a lot of voodoo and swearing. Oh, and mine defaulted to a
serial console once the SRM did get installed and banging on the keyboard
didn't make it recognize the presence of a hardware console.

